<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crĕātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id. (very rare). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A creating, producing, begetting</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">liberorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 1, 7, 15, § 2</span></i>
			.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non hujus creationis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>not of man's building</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Heb. 9, 11</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An electing to an office, a choice</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magistratuum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 3, 3, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tutoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 26, 7, 39, § 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
